      "id": "t03_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Animation = time → shape\n\n`time/seconds` outputs the time elapsed in seconds. Run it through a Math node set to `sin` and you get a smooth oscillation between -1 and 1. A second Math node set to `multiply` scales the motion to pixels.\n\nThis ellipse swings left-right with sin(t)·150.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Animation = time → shape\n\n`time/seconds` outputs the time elapsed in seconds. Run it through `sin` and you get a smooth oscillation between -1 and 1. Multiply to scale the motion to pixels.\n\nThis ellipse swings left-right with sin(t)·150.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
